essed, companies eventually realized that they could collect small pieces of information from a user\u2019s technological habits, and use that to form a profile of the user of some sort. I used a packet-monitoring service to listen in on third-party applications and wrote a script to filter out relevant pieces of data that were being sent back to an application\u2019s server. The findings of this study concluded that third-party iOS applications have unmonitored power to access pieces of information like contacts, location, and emails.","topics":[],"score":181202,"global_rank":404007},{"name":"dblitt/ShulkerStore","owner":"dblitt","html_url":"https://github.com/dblitt/ShulkerStore","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Other","description":null,"topics":[],"score":181202,"global_rank":404008},{"name":"bkenza/go-shell","owner":"bkenza","html_url":"https://github.com/bkenza/go-shell","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Other","description":null,"topics":[],"score":181202,"global_rank":404009},{"name":"dustyjewett/igdb-api-proxy","owner":"dustyjewett","html_url":"https://github.com/dustyjewett/igdb-api-proxy","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Other","description":"A docker image for proxying requests from a client to igdb.","topics":[],"score":181202,"global_rank":404010},{"name":"Iruretagoyena/Analisis_de_Regresion_Multiple","owner":"Iruretagoyena","html_url":"https://github.com/Iruretagoyena/Analisis_de_Regresion_Multiple","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Other","description":null,"topics":[],"score":181202,"global_rank":404011},{"name":"Alex-Angelico/drf-api-permissions-postgres","owner":"Alex-Angelico","html_url":"https://github.com/Alex-Angelico/drf-api-permissions-postgres","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":1,"language":"Other","description":null,"topics":[],"score":181202,"global_rank":404012},{"name":"erinsteiner-NOAA/fisheryconfidentiality","owner":"erinsteiner-NOAA","ht